From: m0wer <m0wer@sgn.space>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:55:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(channelescrowrpc): recover finalized parent after restart

Verify and combine the durably persisted MuSig2 transcript when the in-memory signer attempt no longer exists.\n\nChangelog: Recover channel escrow parent finalization after LND restart
---
 lnrpc/channelescrowrpc/server.go      | 179 ++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 lnrpc/channelescrowrpc/server_test.go |  12 ++
 2 files changed, 177 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lnrpc/channelescrowrpc/server.go b/lnrpc/channelescrowrpc/server.go
